["D Station 360 switching","$3.85M","0.80 / 1.00 / 1.45","Siemens budgetary +/-30% on breakers; balance from unit library at conceptual maturity."],
["E Landfill site platform","$2.69M","0.60 / 1.00 / 2.60","Haugland deducts ($1.47M confirmable) against geotechnical exposure ($0.6M / $1.6M / $3.5M) and soil ($0.4M to $2.6M)."],
["F Station 496 protection","$7.25M","0.80 / 1.00 / 1.40","Own conceptual estimate incl. loaders."],
